OL,3,GNEWSATeacher jailed for sexually
OL,4,Aabusing teenage boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former teacher has been jailed for
OL,7,Ffour and a half years after admitting
OL,8,Fto having sex with a teenage boy.
OL,10,FEmily Drury, 26, was sentenced at
OL,11,FLincoln Crown Court after pleading
OL,12,Fguilty at an earlier hearing to five
OL,13,Fcharges of sexual activity with a
OL,14,Fteenage boy.
OL,16,FA victim impact statement from the boy,
OL,17,Fread out in court, said he went through
OL,18,Fsomething "no child should ever have to
OL,19,Fexperience".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
