OL,5,
OL,6,FIn mitigation, barrister Jeremy James
OL,7,Fdescribed Drury's offending as an
OL,8,F"uncharacteristic, fantastical
OL,9,Frelationship" as a form of "escaping
OL,10,Fthe reality of her life".
